# What `deploy/Containerfile`'s build does not need of the repository (track
# deploy, ADR-XXXX, a production host). Docker and Podman both read this file
# at the context's root. Builds, installs and history stay out: the image's
# build makes its own from the sources and the lockfiles.
.git
**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-*
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.next
**/.svelte-kit
.toolchain
.pnpm-store
docs
